#### 1. Time Complexity: $O(N)$ (Single Pass)
Your previous versions iterated through the data **three times**: once to map indices, once to group by type, and once to compact groups. 
I collapsed this into a **single loop**. We determine the type, calculate the visibility, and place the log into the final result array in one go.

#### 2. Space Complexity: $O(N)$ (Minimal Allocation)
